  description: "2 \"Dual Avatar\" monsters\r\nThis card gains the following effect(s),
    based on the original names of the materials used for its Fusion Summon. \u25CF
    \"Dual Avatar - Empowered Kon-Gyo\": The ATK of your battling \"Dual Avatar\"
    monsters become 3000 during damage calculation only. \u25CF \"Dual Avatar - Empowered
    Mitsu-Jaku\": Once per opponent's turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 card
    on the field; banish it.\r\nIf this Fusion Summoned card is destroyed: You can
    Special Summon 1 \"Dual Avatar Fists - Yuhi\" and 1 \"Dual Avatar Feet - Kokoku\"
    from your Deck, and if you do, they cannot be destroyed by battle or card effects
    this turn."
